<title>JAPAN: Kinki Coca-Cola - 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Kinki Coca-Cola - 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		160.46		vs	  148.90</p>
<p> Operating	   10.12		vs	    8.67</p>
<p> Current		9.13		vs	    8.67</p>
